## English Translation - Day 6: Tactical Planning (The Gathering Storm)

translate english strings:

    old "Fajar hari keenam terbit di balik gulungan awan badai hitam pekat yang berputar rendah di atas puncak granit bukit Ashwood."
    new "The dawn of the sixth day broke behind swirling pitch-black storm clouds hovering low over the granite heights of Ashwood hills."

    old "Angin badai musim dingin mulai melolong ganas dari arah ngarai utara, menghantam daun-daun jendela kaca bertingkat Rose Manor dengan suara erangan panjang yang menyeramkan laksana jeritan arwah gentayangan."
    new "The winter gale wailed fiercely from the northern gorge, thrashing the tiered glass panes of Rose Manor with long, gruesome moans like the cries of wandering spectres."

    old "Hawa dingin di dalam koridor-koridor batu mansion terasa semakin menusuk hingga ke sumsum tulang, seolah kehangatan api perapian marmer ditelan habis oleh gravitasi kegelapan yang merayap naik dari perut bumi."
    new "The chill within the stone corridors grew so biting it pierced to the very marrow, as if the warmth of the marble hearths were swallowed whole by the encroaching gravitational darkness from the earth's depths."

    old "Lampu-lampu gantung kristal raksasa di langit-langit aula bergoyang perlahan, butiran kristalnya berdenting halus satu sama lain akibat getaran mikro seismik gaib yang merambat di sepanjang fondasi batu mansion."
    new "The colossal crystal chandeliers on the hall ceiling swayed gently, their pendants clinking softly in response to faint occult micro-seismic tremors coursing through the stone foundations."

